n,lights\\n 3 https://source.unsplash.com/featured/1200x900?sculpture,museum\\n 4 https://source.unsplash.com/featured/1200x900?museum,crowd\\n 5 https://source.unsplash.com/featured/1200x900?art,installation\\n 6 https://source.unsplash.com/featured/1200x900?theater,stage\\n Artists (generic fictional names): Elena Marsh (Sculptor), Tomasz Wrona (Curator), Ana Lindqvist (Installation Artist), Marek Duda (Sound Artist), Helena Kowal (Performance Artist), Jan Okoń (Photographer), Zofia Brandt (Art Historian), Lucas Ferreira (Composer). Each with a teaser and a longer bio (2–3 sentences) and a session time (e.g., 21:00, 23:00 talk).\\n Accessible modal (role=dialog, aria-modal, aria-labelledby, aria-describedby, focus moved into dialog on open, focus trap via Tab/Shift+Tab, focus returned to trigger on close). Shows name, role, image, longer bio, session time, close button (×, aria-label). Closes on ESC and on backdrop click.\\n5. VENUE: venue name \\\"The Old Gallery\\\", address \\\"ul. Muzealna 12, 00-001 Warsaw\\\" (fictional), travel tips, accessibility notes (step-free entrance, accessible restrooms, assistance on request), parking/public transport notes (Metro line M1 / bus stop nearby). Inline SVG map mock: gallery block rectangle, nearby street lines, metro/bus marker circle, entrance marker, gold route line (dashed/animated optional).\\n6. TICKETS: 3 premium ticket cards:\\n - Night Pass €29: Entry after 19:00; Main exhibition access; Program access.\\n - Curator Pass €59 (RECOMMENDED badge): Everything in Night Pass; Hidden collection tour; Reserved artist talk seating.\\n - Patron Pass €129: Everything in Curator Pass; VIP lounge access; Signed event print; Priority entrance.\\n Each card: \\\"Select\\\" button (opens checkout modal with that tier preselected), hover highlight.\\n Checkout modal (accessible dialog, same focus rules): shows selected tier (select to change), attendee name (required, min 2 chars), email (validated), number of tickets (1–10 stepper or select), total price computed live (price × quantity, €), checkbox \\\"I agree to the terms\\\" (required), \\\"Confirm reservation\\\" button. Inline validation messages (aria-live). On success: close modal, show success toast \\\"Reservation confirmed — no payment was taken (demo).\\\" NO real payment, no payment fields.\\n7. FAQ: accordion (buttons with aria-expanded and aria-controls, panels). At least 6 questions: \\\"Is payment processed on this page?\\\" (No — demo landing page, no real payment), \\\"Can I arrive late?\\\", \\\"Are photos allowed?\\\" (non-flash photography in galleries), \\\"Is the venue accessible?\\\", \\\"Can I change my ticket tier?\\\", \\\"How do I save the event to my calendar?\\\". Only one open at a time or allow multiple; keyboard accessible.\\n8. NEWSLETTER: email input (label, type email, required), submit button, inline validation with regex and aria-live error message; on valid submit show toast \\\"Thanks — you're on the list.\\\" and reset form.\\n9. FOOTER: ARTIFACT logo, event credits (Curated by fictional team, Produced by Night Museum Collective, Warsaw), social-style text links (Instagram, Facebook, Newsletter — href=\\\"#\\\"), copyright \\\"© 2026 ARTIFACT: Museum Night\\\", small note: \\\"Demo landing page — no real ticket purchase.\\\"\\n\\nSAVE TO CALENDAR (JS): generate .ics client-side with Blob and temporary <a download>. Content (CRLF line endings):\\nBEGIN:VCALENDAR / VERSION:2.0 / PRODID:-//ARTIFACT//Museum Night//EN / CALSCALE:GREGORIAN / METHOD:PUBLISH / BEGIN:VEVENT / UID (unique e.g. artifact-museum-night-2026@artifact) / DTSTAMP (current UTC, format YYYYMMDDTHHMMSSZ) / DTSTART:20261018T190000 / DTEND:20261019T020000 / SUMMARY:ARTIFACT: Museum Night / LOCATION:The Old Gallery, Warsaw / DESCRIPTION:A cinematic after-hours museum event with exhibitions, performances, talks, and guided tours. / END:VEVENT / END:VCALENDAR\\nFile name: artifact-museum-night.ics. Revoke object URL after download. Works